# Work folders

One folder per line of work that is not an experiment{{#if modules.experiments}} (those live in
[../experiments/](../experiments/_index.md)){{/if}}: a proof campaign, a family of estimates, the
staging record of a write-up, a literature pass. Each holds its plan and everything the work
produces; throwaway files go in its `scratch/`, which git ignores. Rules:
[docs/discipline/work-folders.md](../docs/discipline/work-folders.md).

To start one, copy `TEMPLATE/` to `work/<slug>/` and add a row below. When it ends, fill in
its README's **Outcome** and change the row's status.

| folder | question | status | what it is for, or what it established |
|---|---|---|---|
